https://github.com/C2SP/CCTV/tree/main/age/testdata, at commit
50a8ecf2a220f4c8bdc4f085789b8e85c26829e7 (2026-09-25). The format of each
file is described in https://github.com/C2SP/CCTV/blob/main/age/README.md.

